### GET - Alle Module + Aktivierungsstatus eines Tenants
GET http://localhost:8080/saas-admin/tenant/98981/modules
Accept: application/json


### PUT - Module für Tenant speichern
PUT http://localhost:8080/saas-admin/tenant/1/modules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "moduleIds": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]
}




### GET - Regeln eines Tenants
GET http://localhost:8080/saas-admin/tenant/1/rules
Accept: application/json


### PUT - Regeln speichern
PUT http://localhost:8080/saas-admin/tenant/1/rules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usageDays": [
    "MONDAY",
    "TUESDAY",
    "WEDNESDAY",
    "THURSDAY",
    "FRIDAY"
  ],
  "restaurantRequired": true,
  "correctionHints": true
}





### GET - Branding eines Tenants
GET http://localhost:8080/saas-admin/tenant/1/branding
Accept: application/json


### PUT - Branding-Entwurf speichern
PUT http://localhost:8080/saas-admin/tenant/1/branding
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appName": "ValidEat Test",
  "shortName": "ValidEat",
  "primaryColor": "#005Fdfgsdfdfg99",
  "accentColor": "#E63946",
  "logo": null
}


### GET - Branding erneut abrufen
GET http://localhost:8080/saas-admin/tenant/1/branding
Accept: application/json


### POST - Branding veröffentlichen
POST http://localhost:8080/saas-admin/tenant/1/branding/publish
Accept: application/json


### GET - Nach Veröffentlichung nochmals prüfen
GET http://localhost:8080/saas-admin/tenant/1/branding
Accept: application/json